      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had this happen yesterday, first time ever. It was busy earlier but at the time of it happening I think there was only myself and one other random person somewhere in the instance. VRChat suddenly started eating up all my available remaining RAM (32gb) with very high CPU usage, and the only way to restore functionality to my PC was to restart VRChat. The session was earlier in my day, around 2.5 hours, and I wasn't in the world for too long when the leak started.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
